authentic insights. Extensive content notes can be found in game and the manual. (see link list at the bottom right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["made by betalars","Polynormal Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515480/98137d58ddd6da7cdaf045527be8b2d1238ec18e/header.jpg?t=1769685148","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Frame of Mind uses a <strong>Creative Commons Non Commercial Share Alike 4.0</strong> license. You can use the game and it's assets freely, as long as you also contribute back to the creative Commons Community. Feel free to reach out if you need a commercial License.<br><br>Attribution to projects that made Frame of Mind possible is provided in Game and in the Wiki. (see external Links)<br><br>Twokinds is created by Thomas J. Fischbach, who granted us permission to use it in a Creative Commons Project.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> when in doubt, check if you can run godot 4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> a CPU starting at first gen ryzen or skylake<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with Vulkan 1.2 support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> will run better on dedicated GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel only<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong